.TH LSSBI 1 "August 2026" "lssbi 0.0.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
lssbi \- inspect the active RISC-V SBI environment
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lssbi
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B lssbi
reports the SBI specification and implementation versions, machine identifiers,
supported SBI extensions, and firmware features exposed by the loaded
.B lssbi_probe
kernel module.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI "--cpu " N
Run per-hart firmware feature queries on Linux CPU
.IR N .
.TP
.B --json
Print a stable, locale-independent JSON document.
.TP
.B --legacy
Probe deprecated legacy SBI extensions.
.TP
.BR -h , " --help"
Print command help.
.TP
.BR -V , " --version"
Print the lssbi version.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B /sys/module/lssbi_probe/parameters/
Read-only SBI records exported by the DKMS backend.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dkms (8)
